🟢 2. Cluster Setup — MUST LEARN
# KIND 
— Local Kubernetes cluster using Docker
KIND ek tool hai jo Docker containers ke andar Kubernetes Cluster banata hai.
> Why use KIND?
Lightweight
Fast cluster creation
Local practice
CI/CD testing me bhi use hota hai

> Installation
winget install Docker.DockerDesktop
winget install Kubernetes.kind
>Create Cluster
kind create cluster --name mycluster
> Check
kubectl get nodes
> Delete Cluster
kind delete cluster --name mycluster

Interview Answer: KIND Docker containers ke andar Kubernetes cluster create karta hai aur local development aur testing ke liye use hota hai.



# Minikube 
— Local Kubernetes learning and testing cluster
Minikube ek single-node local Kubernetes cluster hai jo learning aur practice ke liye banaya gaya hai.
> Why use Minikube?
Beginners ke liye easiest
Dashboard milta hai
Kubernetes commands practice kar sakte ho

> Install
Windows:
Docker Desktop install karo.
Minikube install karo.
> Check version:
// minikube version
> Start Cluster
// minikube start --driver=docker
> Check Status
minikube status
> Open Dashboard
minikube dashboard
> Stop Cluster
minikube stop
> Delete Cluster
minikube delete

Interview Answer: Minikube local machine par single-node Kubernetes cluster create karta hai jo learning aur testing ke liye use hota hai.


