# Amazon EKS 
— Managed Kubernetes service on AWS
Amazon EKS AWS ka managed Kubernetes service hai.

Matlab Kubernetes ka Control Plane AWS manage karta hai aur tum applications deploy karte ho.

> Why EKS?
AWS Control Plane manage karta hai.
High Availability
Automatic updates
AWS services ke saath integration
 
> EKS Architecture
AWS Managed Control Plane
Worker Nodes (EC2/Fargate)Pods
Services

>Create EKS Cluster (using eksctl)
eksctl create cluster \
--name dev-cluster \
--region ap-south-1 \
--nodes 2

Check nodes:
kubectl get nodes

Delete:
eksctl delete cluster --name dev-cluster

Priority: Learn Minikube/KIND for practice and EKS for real-world DevOps. Kubeadm only needs basic understanding initially.
